---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<footer class="bg-[#141814] py-16 text-white md:py-20">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 md:px-8">
		<div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-10">
			<div class="md:col-span-5">
				<a href="/" class="inline-block">
					<img
						src="/images/logo_bianco.png"
						alt="Valsesia Electric Green"
						class="block h-auto w-auto max-w-[min(130px,100%)] object-contain object-left sm:max-w-[136px] md:max-w-[144px]"
						width="828"
						height="214"
						loading="lazy"
						decoding="async"
					/>
				</a>
				<p class="mt-6 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65">
					Tour ed escursioni in moto elettrica tra Piemonte e Valsesia. Silenzio, natura, professionalità.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#18b24b]/30 bg-[#18b24b]/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#7ddf9e]">
					<Icon name="badge-check" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#7ddf9e]" />
					Partner ufficiale Talaria Italia
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2 md:col-span-4">
				<div>
					<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/40">Navigazione</p>
					<nav class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-white/75">
						<a href="#storia" class="transition hover:text-[#18b24b]">Storia</a>
						<a href="#offerta" class="transition hover:text-[#18b24b]">Sede & tour</a>
						<a href="#elettrico" class="transition hover:text-[#18b24b]">Perché elettrico</a>
						<a href="#azioni" class="transition hover:text-[#18b24b]">Galleria</a>
						<a href="#contatti" class="transition hover:text-[#18b24b]">Contatti</a>
					</nav>
				</div>
				<div>
					<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/40">Legale</p>
					<nav class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-white/75">
						<a href="/privacy" class="transition hover:text-[#18b24b]">Privacy Policy</a>
						<a href="/cookie" class="transition hover:text-[#18b24b]">Cookie Policy</a>
					</nav>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="md:col-span-3">
				<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/40">Contatti</p>
				<p class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/75">
					<Icon name="phone" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-white/50" />
					347 6987492
				</p>
				<p class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/75">
					<Icon name="mail" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-white/50" />
					info@spservicess.it
				</p>
				<p class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/75">
					<Icon name="map-pin" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-white/50" />
					Borgosesia (VC)
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div
			class="mt-14 flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 text-xs text-white/45 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"
		>
			<p>© 2025 Valsesia Electric Green, Tutti i diritti riservati</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
